# Managed by Chef cookbook: cdo-otel-collector
# Forwards all syslog messages to the OpenTelemetry Collector syslog receiver
# (RFC 3164, TCP 127.0.0.1:54526). Numbered 51 so it loads after the file-output
# rule in 50-default.conf; both rules fire independently.
#
# A LinkedList queue of up to 10,000 messages buffers if the collector is temporarily
# unavailable (caps memory exposure to ~10k message objects). resumeRetryCount=-1
# retries indefinitely rather than dropping messages once the queue is drained.
*.* action(type="omfwd"
           target="127.0.0.1"
           port="54526"
           protocol="tcp"
           queue.type="LinkedList"
           queue.size="10000"
           action.resumeRetryCount="-1")
